{% doc %}
Clean Refine Products V3 for Stateside Quartermaster collection roots. State Guard Series is deliberately excluded. Uses server-rendered Shopify product cards and native storefront filter parameters. Structural collection navigation is converted to checkbox disclosures. Products per page supports 50, 100, and 250 by combining server-rendered 50-product collection pages from a dedicated alternate view.
{% enddoc %}
{% if request.page_type == 'collection' and collection.handle != 'state-guard-series' %}
{% assign sq_v3_handle = collection.handle | downcase %}
<script type="application/json" data-sq-refine-v3-book-tags>{% if sq_v3_handle == 'literature' %}{{ collection.all_tags | json }}{% else %}[]{% endif %}</script>
